* ============================================================================
* fullstack_pre_refresh_runtime_v1.dts -- DOCFLUSH-20260812-001 (flush v5)
* Phase 2 runtime baseline.
*
* WHAT IS DIFFERENT ABOUT THIS BASELINE, and it must not be glossed: this is
* NOT a pre-refresh capture. The HELP store was rebuilt ad hoc on 2026-08-12
* (`cmdhelp build . d:\code\ccode\src`) with no Gate 0, no prior baseline, and
* no Gate 4 validation -- and with the documented dotref recipe half-skipped
* (CMDHELP BUILD LEGACY was not run first, and the store was not backed up).
*
* So this transcript captures a store that has ALREADY MOVED, from a state
* nobody recorded. Its job is to establish the first gated ground truth since
* v4's Gate 4, so the correct rebuild later in this run has something honest to
* be compared against. Gate 2 must say so plainly rather than presenting these
* numbers as a clean pre-refresh line.
*
* Read the transcript for mojibake as well as counts: a source em-dash inside a
* contract block renders as a CP437 garble in HELP output, which is how v4 found
* cmd_buildvectors.cpp:21. Measured 2026-08-12: 0 non-ASCII remain inside any
* @dottalk.usage block tree-wide, so this run expects a CLEAN transcript. A
* garble here would mean the store predates commit 4c584ba8f and the rebuild did
* not take.
*
* Run (from D:\code\ccode, ABSOLUTE paths -- datarun pushes cwd to the data root):
*   $run = 'D:\code\ccode\docs\maintenance\lanes\full_stack_documentation\runs\DOCFLUSH-20260812-001\runtime_baseline'
*   ./datarun.ps1 -CommandLines (Get-Content "$run\fullstack_pre_refresh_runtime_v1.dts") |
*     Tee-Object "$run\fullstack_pre_refresh_runtime_v1.txt"
*   Set-Location D:\code\ccode
*
* Read-only: every command below reports. Nothing rebuilds, nothing writes HELP.
* ============================================================================
SET ECHO OFF
STOP_ON_ERROR OFF

FORMULA "DOCFLUSH-V5-BASELINE-BEGIN"

* --- runtime identity: binds the transcript to an exe and a commit ----------
ABOUT

* --- HELP store as it currently stands (the ad-hoc-rebuilt state) -----------
CMDHELP
CMDHELP TOPICS

* --- structural check of that store -----------------------------------------
CMDHELPCHK

* --- the reference authorities, each reporting its own surface ---------------
DOTHELP
FOXHELP

* --- manual state (v4 recorded 8/8; re-measure, do not assume) --------------
